title: Remove `Printable` trait
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Removes the `Printable` trait and `sp_runtime::print` together with the `frame_support::print`
    and `frame_support::traits::Printable` re-exports. `Dispatchable::PostInfo` and
    `DispatchErrorWithPostInfo` no longer require `Printable`. The remaining call sites now log
    through `log`. Downstream code that used `print` or implemented `Printable` should switch to
    `log` and drop the impls.
crates:
- name: sp-runtime
  bump: major
- name: frame-support
  bump: major
- name: sp-staking
  bump: major
- name: sp-npos-elections
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-democracy
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-im-online
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-session
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-staking
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-treasury
  bump: patch
